---
---
<section id="oferta" class="section-py pricing-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pricing-card-wrapper">
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <div class="pricing-badge-popular">
          <span class="fire-icon">🔥</span>
          <span>OFERTA ESPECIAL POR TEMPO LIMITADO</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing-header">
          <h2>Treinamento Completo: Elimine as Birras Sem Stress</h2>
          <p>O método definitivo para ter calma, controle e cooperação com seu filho todos os dias.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing-stack-list">
          <div class="stack-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="item-name">Curso Completo Elimine as Birras (4 Módulos Práticos)</span>
            <span class="item-val">R$ 297,00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="item-name">Bônus #01: Livro Digital Neurociência Revelada</span>
            <span class="item-val">R$ 67,00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="item-name">Bônus #02: Dinâmica Botão da Calma Instantânea</span>
            <span class="item-val">R$ 47,00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="item-name">Bônus #03: Masterclass 5 Ferramentas de Educação Respeitosa</span>
            <span class="item-val">R$ 97,00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="item-name">Bônus #04: Guia Rápido SOS de Bolso (PDF Imprimível)</span>
            <span class="item-val">R$ 47,00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-item">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="item-name">Acesso Imediato e Vitalício + Suporte Pedagógico a Dúvidas</span>
            <span class="item-val item-included">Incluso</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pricing-value-box">
          <div class="total-value-row">
            <span>Valor Total de Todos os Itens:</span>
            <span class="crossed-total">R$ 555,00</span>
          </div>

          <div class="final-price-box">
            <span class="installment-label">Por Apenas 12x de</span>
            <div class="price-digits">
              <span class="currency">R$</span>
              <span class="amount">9,74</span>
            </div>
            <span class="cash-label">ou <strong>R$ 97,00 à vista</strong> (Menos de R$ 0,32 por dia)</span>
          </div>

          <div class="pricing-anchor-pill">
            <span>💡 <em>R$ 97 é menos do que uma pizza no fim de semana ou uma única consulta avulsa. É o investimento definitivo para ter paz, respeito e cooperação todos os dias.</em></span>
          </div>

          <a href="https://pay.hotmart.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-cta btn-pricing">
            <span>SIM, QUERO ELIMINAR AS BIRRAS AGORA!</span>
            <span class="sub-text">🔒 Pagamento 100% Seguro • Acesso Imediato</span>
          </a>

          <div class="pricing-guarantees-row">
            <div class="guarantee-badge-item">
              <span>🛡️ 7 Dias de Garantia</span>
            </div>
            <div class="guarantee-badge-item">
              <span>⚡ Liberação Imediata</span>
            </div>
            <div class="guarantee-badge-item">
              <span>💳 PIX ou Cartão em 12x</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pricing-section {
    position: relative;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.07) 0%, rgba(250, 249, 246, 1) 70%);
  }

  .pricing-card-wrapper {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pricing-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #10B981;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.22), 0 0 0 1px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    padding: 3.75rem 3.25rem 3.25rem 3.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .pricing-badge-popular {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.25rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981 0%, #059669 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
    white-space: nowrap;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .fire-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .pricing-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.15rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .pricing-header p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .pricing-stack-list {
    background: var(--bg-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .stack-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.975rem;
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: #D1FAE5;
    color: #059669;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .item-name {
    flex-grow: 1;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .item-val {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .item-included {
    color: #059669;
    background: #D1FAE5;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .pricing-value-box {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.35rem;
  }

  .total-value-row {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .crossed-total {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .final-price-box {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .installment-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .price-digits {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin: 0.15rem 0;
  }

  .currency {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .amount {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 4.75rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-cta-hover);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .cash-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .pricing-anchor-pill {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: #92400E;
    background: #FEF3C7;
    border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .btn-pricing {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    padding: 1.35rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pricing-guarantees-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pricing-card {
      padding: 2.75rem 1.25rem 2rem 1.25rem;
    }
    .pricing-header h2 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .amount {
      font-size: 3.75rem;
    }
    .pricing-guarantees-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
